---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — PaddleFitHub"
  description="PaddleFitHub privacy policy. Learn how we handle your data, localStorage usage, and analytics."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <div class="bg-canvas-soft">
    <div class="container-narrow py-12 md:py-16">
      <h1 class="text-display-xl text-ink mb-4">Privacy policy.</h1>
      <p class="text-caption text-mute mb-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-body-md text-body">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Overview</h2>
          <p>
            PaddleFitHub ("we," "our," or "us") operates the website paddlefithub.com. This privacy policy
            explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you use our website and calculators.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We are committed to protecting your privacy. Our calculators are designed to work without
            collecting personal data, and we do not require account creation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Information we collect</h2>

          <h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink mb-2 mt-4">Calculator data (localStorage)</h3>
          <p>
            Some of our calculators save your inputs (such as hand measurements and preferences) to your
            browser's localStorage. This data is stored entirely on your device and is never transmitted
            to our servers. You can clear this data at any time by clearing your browser data or using
            your browser's developer tools.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink mb-2 mt-4">Analytics data</h3>
          <p>
            We may use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our website. Google Analytics
            collects anonymous usage data such as pages visited, time on site, and general geographic
            location. This data does not identify you personally. You can opt out of Google Analytics
            by using the
            <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-link hover:underline" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
              Google Analytics Opt-Out Browser Add-on</a>.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink mb-2 mt-4">Contact form data</h3>
          <p>
            If you submit our contact form, we collect your name, email address, and message. This
            information is used solely to respond to your inquiry and is not shared with third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">How we use information</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>To provide and improve our calculator tools</li>
            <li>To understand how visitors use our website</li>
            <li>To respond to contact form submissions</li>
            <li>To maintain and improve website performance</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            Our website may use cookies from analytics services (such as Google Analytics). These cookies
            help us understand aggregate usage patterns. We do not use cookies for advertising or tracking
            across other websites.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Third-party services</h2>
          <p>
            We use the following third-party services:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — website analytics and usage tracking</li>
            <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — website hosting and content delivery</li>
            <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — web font delivery</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Each of these services has its own privacy policy that governs their data handling practices.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Data security</h2>
          <p>
            Our website is served over HTTPS to encrypt data in transit. Since we do not collect personal
            data through our calculators, there is no personal calculator data at risk on our servers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Children's privacy</h2>
          <p>
            Our website is not directed at children under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect
            personal information from children.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page
            with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes
            acceptance of the updated policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at
            <a href="mailto:allenquirys01@gmail.com" class="text-link hover:underline">allenquirys01@gmail.com</a>
            or visit our <a href="/contact/" class="text-link hover:underline">contact page</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
